      "text": "The deployment finally worked. My celebratory dance was mercifully undocumented.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "contribution-boundary",
      "text": "I helped build the scheduler.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "uncertainty-and-condition",
      "text": "The cache may reduce latency by ~10% for repeated requests, but cold starts are untested.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "literal-review-word",
      "text": "The tapestry depicts a coastal landscape.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "protected-quotation",
      "text": "Her note read: \"Not today—but soon.\"",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "already-clear",
      "text": "Please send the invoice by Friday.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "participial-tail",
      "text": "The team launched the dashboard on Tuesday.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "aspiration-not-capability",
      "text": "The prototype aims to detect duplicate invoices. We have not tested its accuracy.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematical-representation",
      "text": "The vector represents velocity. The robust regression estimates the slope while limiting outlier effects.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "plain-punctuation",
      "text": "The migration is complete. \"Ready to launch,\" the manager said. We still need to check the backups.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-paragraph",
      "text": "On Tuesday, I deployed the cache to two servers. Median latency fell from 80 ms to 60 ms for repeated requests in a 30‑minute test. We have not tested cold starts or the other eight servers. The dashboard still shows yesterday's data.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "useful-parallel-list",
      "text": "Before release:\n- Verify the signature.\n- Verify the checksum.\n- Verify the version.",
